      raw,
      req.headers['stripe-signature'],
      process.env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY
    );
```

You usually want to pass a webhook signing key (begins with `whsec_`) to constructEvent (see [here](https://stripe.com/docs/webhooks/signatures#verify-official-libraries)), not your stripe secret key, which is different.

If that's not it, I recommend contacting Stripe support (https://support.stripe.com/contact). I don't *think* this is a bug in stripe-node, and support can help you get to the root of the problem a bit more interactively than we can here.

